sequenceDiagram
 participant OS as FileSystem
 participant W as Watcher
 participant E as Engine
 participant CAS as CAS
 participant DB as Turso
 participant Cloud as StorageProvider
 OS->>W: modify/path event
 W->>E: stabilized candidate
 E->>CAS: stream sha256+zstd
 CAS-->>E: content hash
 alt unchanged hash
 E-->>W: no new version
 else changed hash
 E->>DB: BEGIN resource+version+event
 DB-->>E: COMMIT
 E->>Cloud: encrypt+upload if policy allows
 Cloud-->>E: object locator
 E->>Cloud: readback
 E->>E: decrypt+sha256 verify
 E->>DB: verified archive record
 end
